WEBVTT

00:04.980 --> 00:07.670
<i>I worked as a salaryman 
for a toxic company,</i>

00:07.670 --> 00:09.670
<i>until I reincarnated...</i>

00:09.670 --> 00:13.960
<i>in a crazy world where everything is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i>

00:13.960 --> 00:18.830
<i>In my new life, I'm level 1, 
but I have a unique skill</i>

00:18.830 --> 00:21.000
<i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i>

00:21.480 --> 00:24.770
<i>Wait, no one's allowed into this dungeon?!</i>

00:24.770 --> 00:27.800
<i>What even is a "dungeon master," anyway?!</i>

00:36.140 --> 00:45.270
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:00.020 --> 02:05.030
<b>You Can Do It!







Get 'Em, Celeste!</b>

02:06.380 --> 02:08.490
Well done today!

02:12.820 --> 02:14.730
And there's more!

02:14.730 --> 02:16.690
I'll go get it!

02:17.750 --> 02:22.260
She's going way too hard just 
because my work here is easing up.

02:22.260 --> 02:25.120
You've done very well, Ryota.

02:25.120 --> 02:26.500
Thanks.

02:26.500 --> 02:30.680
It's not like they've decided Selen 
belongs to Secro yet, though.

02:30.680 --> 02:33.460
Once that decision is made, 
it'll truly be over.

02:33.460 --> 02:36.220
Then we can go back to Secro 
with nothing left to worry about.

02:37.550 --> 02:39.970
I hope they make the decision quickly.

02:41.790 --> 02:44.270
Ta-da! It's a cake!

02:44.270 --> 02:46.500
What? How did you get that?

02:46.500 --> 02:48.280
I baked it over the campfire.

02:48.280 --> 02:51.140
Campfire? You mean... that campfire?

02:51.140 --> 02:52.060
Celeste...

02:52.060 --> 02:53.880
Don't think too hard about it.

02:53.880 --> 02:55.200
Huh? But...

02:55.200 --> 02:56.840
There's ice cream, too!

02:56.840 --> 02:59.210
What?! How do you have ice cream?!

03:30.740 --> 03:31.600
Celeste!

03:38.810 --> 03:40.700
Ryota?

03:40.700 --> 03:42.130
Try not to move.

03:45.530 --> 03:46.930
It's a healing bullet.

03:48.470 --> 03:49.680
Are you okay?

03:50.460 --> 03:52.750
Yes... Huh?

03:55.130 --> 03:57.680
Hey, Celeste, was that—

03:58.600 --> 04:02.540
O-Oh, no! 
Why is my heart pounding so hard?!

04:02.540 --> 04:04.130
And my face feels hot!

04:04.130 --> 04:05.750
C-Celeste...

04:07.310 --> 04:08.900
Celeste?!

04:10.540 --> 04:13.060
C-Calm down, Celeste!

04:14.420 --> 04:15.910
I'm calm now.

04:15.910 --> 04:17.190
R-Really?

04:17.520 --> 04:18.840
Yes, really.

04:18.840 --> 04:23.380
Anyway, weren't you about 
to ask me something?

04:23.380 --> 04:25.120
O-Oh...

04:25.120 --> 04:28.320
You know, that trash you just burned...

04:28.320 --> 04:30.110
There wasn't that much.

04:30.590 --> 04:34.540
Did you really need to use a 
huge spell like that on it?

04:34.540 --> 04:37.600
That's the only one I can use.

04:37.600 --> 04:38.390
Huh?

04:38.390 --> 04:41.810
The level 3 fire magic spell, Inferno.

04:42.360 --> 04:45.830
It's the only magic I can use.

04:45.830 --> 04:49.100
Level 3? What about levels 1 and 2?

04:50.410 --> 04:51.900
I can't use them.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.570
'Scuse us!

04:55.890 --> 04:56.840
Of course.

05:10.800 --> 05:12.340
I'll help you.

05:12.340 --> 05:14.710
I have time now that my work's done.

05:14.710 --> 05:16.330
It's a lot to handle alone, isn't it?

05:16.810 --> 05:18.890
Th-Thank you...

05:24.770 --> 05:25.600
Except...

05:25.600 --> 05:28.680
We keep burning and burning, 
but it's not even making a dent!

05:28.680 --> 05:30.390
Is it always like this?!

05:30.390 --> 05:32.410
Today is special.

05:32.410 --> 05:35.230
Apparently, the dungeon master has shown up.

05:35.230 --> 05:38.440
Dungeon master? What's that?

05:38.440 --> 05:42.480
The boss of a dungeon. 
They only show up once every few months.

05:42.480 --> 05:44.760
They're very strong, dangerous monsters.

05:44.760 --> 05:47.980
No one's allowed to enter the 
dungeon now because of it,

05:47.980 --> 05:49.680
so everyone's just stress-eating.

05:49.680 --> 05:51.800
And that led to this.

05:53.090 --> 05:55.260
Ch-Cheer up!

05:55.260 --> 05:58.480
They'll have a team together 
to get rid of it in no time!

05:58.480 --> 06:01.380
I'm sure things will be back 
to normal by tomorrow!

06:01.380 --> 06:03.940
You're right. Thank you.

06:03.940 --> 06:07.600
Celeste, you should call it a day now.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.280
I'll handle the rest.

06:09.280 --> 06:10.900
What? I couldn't!

06:10.900 --> 06:12.120
This is my—

06:13.100 --> 06:16.130
If you keep this up, you'll pass out again.

06:16.130 --> 06:17.850
Just go and rest now.

06:17.850 --> 06:19.940
You're always pushing yourself too hard.

06:22.930 --> 06:25.700
So on that note, she's all yours, Emily.

06:25.700 --> 06:26.850
Got it!

06:26.850 --> 06:28.750
Come on, now, let's go!

06:28.750 --> 06:30.930
What? W-Wait...

06:34.340 --> 06:36.800
Okay, let's do this!

06:37.260 --> 06:41.180
<b>The Next Day</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:43.100
There's so much again today...

06:43.100 --> 06:44.110
Yes...

06:44.110 --> 06:46.010
It'll be all right.

06:46.010 --> 06:49.280
The team to get rid of the dungeon 
master should be assembled now.

06:49.280 --> 06:51.840
I'll go check on where things stand, then.

06:51.840 --> 06:55.200
You'll feel better knowing 
there's an end in sight, right?

06:55.200 --> 06:56.820
Y-Yes...

06:56.820 --> 06:58.880
Okay, I'll go check it out.

06:58.880 --> 07:02.070
Celeste, don't push yourself too hard!

07:02.940 --> 07:04.010
Why?

07:04.440 --> 07:05.280
What?

07:05.280 --> 07:10.090
Why is Ryota so kind to me?

07:11.390 --> 07:13.890
That's just the sort of person he is.

07:13.890 --> 07:17.340
When he sees someone who
 needs help, he can't ignore them.

07:17.340 --> 07:19.010
It was the same in Secro, too.

07:19.170 --> 07:20.920
In Secro, too?

07:21.540 --> 07:24.220
Once that decision is made, 
it'll truly be over.

07:24.220 --> 07:27.030
Then we can go back to Secro 
with nothing left to worry about.

07:31.340 --> 07:33.730
Hey, if it isn't Sato.

07:33.730 --> 07:34.720
What?

07:35.240 --> 07:37.570
Neptune? Why are you here?

07:38.860 --> 07:41.400
Since the dungeon master has appeared,

07:41.400 --> 07:45.530
we've asked the Neptune Group 
to come and help defeat it.

07:45.530 --> 07:48.610
Perfect timing! That's why I'm here.

07:48.920 --> 07:51.770
Please get rid of the dungeon 
master as soon as possible.

07:51.770 --> 07:53.790
I have a friend who's in trouble.

07:53.790 --> 07:56.330
I'd love to to that myself, honestly.

07:56.330 --> 07:57.920
Is there some reason you can't?

07:58.340 --> 08:00.950
Things have gone a bit awry.

08:00.950 --> 08:02.420
They have?

08:02.930 --> 08:07.460
Our agreement with Hetero dictates 
that if a dungeon master appears,

08:07.460 --> 08:10.420
the two towns must assemble 
a joint force to defeat it.

08:11.020 --> 08:14.240
We've decided to send the 
Neptune Group from our side,

08:14.810 --> 08:17.930
but Hetero isn't even making 
an effort to pick anyone.

08:17.930 --> 08:20.900
They won't even try? Why not?

08:20.900 --> 08:23.120
Because that works out better for them.

08:23.530 --> 08:26.440
If a dungeon master sticks 
around for a long time,

08:26.440 --> 08:29.320
the whole ecology of its dungeon can change.

08:29.820 --> 08:34.550
And if its ecology changes, the items 
that drop there change, as well.

08:34.550 --> 08:35.880
You mean...

08:35.880 --> 08:39.550
Yes. The dungeon was 
practically in Secro's hands,

08:39.550 --> 08:43.550
but this might send us back to square one.

08:43.980 --> 08:46.460
That's what Hetero is after.

08:46.460 --> 08:48.470
I'll go in, then.

08:48.470 --> 08:50.500
Forget about the joint force.

08:50.500 --> 08:53.710
If I go after it on my own, 
there's no problem, right?

08:54.320 --> 08:56.470
No. I can't allow that, either.

08:56.470 --> 08:57.760
Why not?!

08:57.760 --> 09:00.560
You all have your own rule, apparently.

09:00.560 --> 09:01.580
Huh?

09:01.580 --> 09:05.770
Only a group of no less 
than three adventurers

09:05.770 --> 09:08.720
with stats ranked A or 
higher are allowed in.

09:08.720 --> 09:10.370
Why is that the rule?

09:10.370 --> 09:13.780
That's just how dangerous 
the dungeon master is!

09:15.670 --> 09:16.780
I apologize.

09:18.380 --> 09:20.130
Neptune, why don't you and I—

09:20.130 --> 09:21.040
I can't.

09:21.580 --> 09:26.280
We came here on a contract to be 
Secro's part of the joint force.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.550
I can't act on my own.

09:31.560 --> 09:32.850
What are you gonna go?

09:33.010 --> 09:37.390
I'll check around with the people 
here to find some who'll help me.

09:37.940 --> 09:39.890
That's not going to be easy.

09:40.200 --> 09:40.990
Huh?

09:42.520 --> 09:44.280
All the adventurers here

09:44.280 --> 09:48.390
are people who came to profit off 
of drops while they're tax-exempt.

09:48.730 --> 09:52.750
None of them are ambitious enough 
to take on a dungeon master.

09:56.070 --> 09:58.290
Welcome back, Yoda!

09:58.290 --> 10:00.030
I'm back... wait...

10:00.590 --> 10:02.460
What's going on, Emily?

10:02.460 --> 10:05.330
You're going to defeat the 
dungeon master, aren't you?

10:05.330 --> 10:07.370
I'm going with you!

10:07.370 --> 10:09.460
I can always count on you.

10:09.460 --> 10:14.020
Sorry, though. The two of us can't 
go into the dungeon on our own.

10:14.020 --> 10:15.120
We need one more—

10:15.120 --> 10:16.350
I know.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.830
I'm going, too.

10:20.990 --> 10:22.520
Celeste?

10:22.520 --> 10:25.720
You're going? What about the trash?

10:25.720 --> 10:29.450
It's all right. 
I found someone willing to help.

10:29.450 --> 10:31.620
You found someone to help?

10:31.620 --> 10:33.380
Hey!

10:33.380 --> 10:35.000
Sis!

10:35.870 --> 10:36.970
Eugene?!

10:36.970 --> 10:41.050
This is the one who's agreed 
to burn the trash in my place.

10:41.050 --> 10:41.790
Huh?!

10:42.310 --> 10:46.320
Just so you know, this isn't to 
apologize for last time or anything!

10:46.320 --> 10:50.500
I only agreed to do it 'cause 
she said she'd pay me!

10:50.500 --> 10:55.380
O-Okay... Can you handle 
it by yourself, though?

10:55.380 --> 10:56.770
It's not just me!

10:56.770 --> 10:57.780
Huh?

10:58.190 --> 11:00.000
Come on, bring it over here.

11:03.100 --> 11:04.990
They're...

11:04.990 --> 11:08.220
So as you can see, everything's gonna be fine!

11:08.220 --> 11:09.540
Y-Yeah.

11:10.270 --> 11:12.190
What's the holdup, Eugene?

11:12.190 --> 11:14.100
Get over here and help us already.

11:14.100 --> 11:16.030
Oh, shut up!

11:17.870 --> 11:20.500
We can let them handle things here.

11:20.500 --> 11:23.040
Yes, while we head to the dungeon.

11:23.040 --> 11:27.420
W-Well... just having three 
of us isn't enough, actually.

11:27.420 --> 11:31.460
We all need to have stats 
ranked A or higher to go in.

11:31.800 --> 11:33.490
No problem there.

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>"Celeste"</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Level</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Status</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Strength</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Vitality</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Intelligence</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Will</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Speed</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:37.170
<b>Dexterity</b>

11:33.980 --> 11:37.170
<b>Luck</b>

11:37.190 --> 11:39.310
Your intelligence and will are rank A?!

11:39.680 --> 11:42.350
My drop rates are terrible, though.

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>"Celeste"</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Level</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Drop Status</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Plants</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Animals</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Minerals</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Magic</b>

11:42.840 --> 11:46.100
<b>Specials</b>

11:46.110 --> 11:49.160
But if I'm with you, 
you can go into the dungeon.

11:49.160 --> 11:51.780
Are you really sure about this?

11:52.300 --> 11:53.140
Yes.

11:53.650 --> 11:57.370
You'll go back to Secro eventually.

11:57.370 --> 11:58.260
So...

11:58.860 --> 12:02.800
Please take me along. I want to help you.

12:05.200 --> 12:07.190
Thanks, Celeste.

12:08.330 --> 12:11.970
Vroom, vroom, vroom, vroom... screech!

12:10.550 --> 12:11.570
My...

12:14.790 --> 12:16.720
Once this is done, we can go home.

12:14.830 --> 12:18.040
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:14.830 --> 12:18.040
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:16.720 --> 12:18.050
I want to go home right now.

12:18.060 --> 12:21.350
<b>Selen Level 1</b>

12:25.070 --> 12:28.060
There are... no monsters?

12:28.230 --> 12:31.820
Right. While the dungeon master's around,

12:31.820 --> 12:34.490
all the other monsters go away.

12:34.650 --> 12:37.040
All other monsters leave?

12:37.040 --> 12:39.980
What about all the drops, then?

12:39.980 --> 12:41.900
There are no drops to find.

12:41.900 --> 12:46.120
That's why we have to defeat the 
dungeon master as soon as possible.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.940
That's crazy.

13:08.820 --> 13:11.330
Is that the dungeon master?

13:11.330 --> 13:13.320
A horse with two horns...

13:13.320 --> 13:15.110
I've heard of this before.

13:15.280 --> 13:17.300
A beast that taints the pure...

13:17.300 --> 13:18.400
The bicorn!

13:18.830 --> 13:20.190
Bicorn?

13:23.060 --> 13:24.340
Let's do this, Emily!

13:24.340 --> 13:25.410
Right!

13:31.200 --> 13:32.410
Did that do it?!

13:45.590 --> 13:47.030
Oh, no, you don't!

13:53.010 --> 13:55.910
What the heck was that? A barrier?

13:55.910 --> 13:57.310
I don't know!

13:57.310 --> 13:59.730
Well, all we can do is keep pushing!

13:59.730 --> 14:02.310
Celeste! Back me up!

14:02.310 --> 14:03.120
Right!

14:05.160 --> 14:07.710
Burn! Inferno!

14:12.120 --> 14:14.000
It's staying in one place!

14:14.000 --> 14:15.050
Now I can...

14:20.140 --> 14:21.180
Emily!

14:26.060 --> 14:27.220
Yes!

14:30.230 --> 14:31.560
Again?!

14:31.560 --> 14:35.380
It's okay! I can blow up its 
barrier with bullet fusions!

14:35.380 --> 14:37.710
I want to hit it with the 
same chain of attacks again.

14:37.710 --> 14:39.440
Can you do it, Celeste?

14:39.440 --> 14:41.360
Yes, of course.

14:41.920 --> 14:42.860
What?

14:42.860 --> 14:45.110
Mr. Sato went to the dungeon?!

14:46.640 --> 14:49.400
That's my Sato. Nothing stops him.

14:49.400 --> 14:51.420
This is not a laughing matter!

14:51.420 --> 14:55.710
You know the bicorn's power 
poses a tremendous threat!

15:00.760 --> 15:02.530
It sure is resilient.

15:02.530 --> 15:05.290
I feel like we've done a lot of damage...

15:05.290 --> 15:08.290
Then we just have to keep 
going until it falls!

15:08.290 --> 15:10.770
Yes, what Emily said!

15:10.770 --> 15:12.990
All right, then...

15:15.870 --> 15:18.390
That looks like trouble! We gotta stop it!

15:18.390 --> 15:19.330
Right!

15:23.240 --> 15:24.410
Emily!

15:25.150 --> 15:30.610
m 0 0 l -70 0 l -76 -6 l -76 -47 l -70 -53 l -47 -53 l -47 -51 l -70 -51 l -74 -47 l -74 -6 l -70 -2 l 0 -2

15:25.150 --> 15:30.610
m 0 0 l -70 0 l -76 -6 l -76 -47 l -70 -53 l -47 -53 l -47 -51 l -70 -51 l -74 -47 l -74 -6 l -70 -2 l 0 -2

15:25.150 --> 15:30.610
Ryota has dropped two ranks
in all stats except HP and strength.

15:25.390 --> 15:30.630
<i>Ryota has dropped two ranks in all 
stats except HP and strength.</i>

15:30.630 --> 15:31.450
Wha—

15:36.460 --> 15:37.370
Emily!

15:39.170 --> 15:40.780
I'm all right!

15:40.780 --> 15:43.210
But, Yoda, did it just...

15:43.210 --> 15:47.480
Yeah. It lowered all my stats 
other than HP and strength.

15:47.480 --> 15:48.390
Yours?

15:48.390 --> 15:50.510
It lowered all of mine.

15:50.510 --> 15:51.990
Is Celeste...

15:52.310 --> 15:53.600
Celeste!

15:53.600 --> 15:55.190
Celeste?

15:56.160 --> 16:00.200
<i>Oh, right. With her stats 
lowered, her MP would be...</i>

16:03.610 --> 16:05.870
<i>I can't let her push herself any farther.</i>

16:06.400 --> 16:08.690
Emily, take care of Celeste!

16:08.690 --> 16:11.620
I'll finish this... somehow.

16:11.620 --> 16:14.600
Understood. Be careful.

16:14.600 --> 16:19.350
I'm sorry. I only ended up slowing you down.

16:19.700 --> 16:21.630
That's not true.

16:21.630 --> 16:24.590
You did more than enough to help us out.

16:25.960 --> 16:28.900
So just rest for a while.

16:29.430 --> 16:33.090
Your help isn't as important 
as you yourself are.

16:39.700 --> 16:43.490
No one's ever said anything 
like that to me before...

16:44.140 --> 16:46.610
Why are you so inefficient?!

16:47.120 --> 16:49.680
Can't you burn that stuff any faster?

16:50.230 --> 16:53.200
If you're gonna be sick, tell me first!

16:53.200 --> 16:55.650
Save the collapsing for 
after you finish the job!

16:56.080 --> 16:59.020
<i>People have only ever 
said harsh things to me.</i>

16:59.830 --> 17:02.810
<i>Since I can only use level 3 magic,</i>

17:02.810 --> 17:05.110
<i>I just accepted it as natural.</i>

17:06.270 --> 17:07.870
That's not true.

17:09.250 --> 17:13.240
You did more than enough to help us out.

17:22.090 --> 17:23.720
<i>I never knew...</i>

17:24.140 --> 17:28.230
<i>that someone's approval 
could make me so happy.</i>

17:29.850 --> 17:31.170
Celeste?

17:31.820 --> 17:34.040
I can't afford to rest.

17:35.050 --> 17:36.490
I want to give my all...

17:37.060 --> 17:38.390
right now!

17:40.430 --> 17:41.450
Yoda!

17:42.280 --> 17:43.580
Celeste?

17:46.000 --> 17:47.840
Burn!

17:48.240 --> 17:49.760
Inferno!

17:56.020 --> 17:58.310
Yoda! Use this!

18:21.300 --> 18:22.860
We did it!

18:22.860 --> 18:23.710
Wait...

18:23.710 --> 18:25.040
Celeste!

18:27.360 --> 18:28.680
Celeste!

18:28.850 --> 18:30.710
Is the bicorn...

18:30.710 --> 18:32.490
We defeated it!

18:32.970 --> 18:36.430
Thanks, Celeste. We couldn't 
have done it without you.

18:41.950 --> 18:46.020
I'm so glad... I could be of help...

18:47.610 --> 18:49.730
Here. Take these.

18:50.390 --> 18:51.490
What are they?

18:51.490 --> 18:53.200
The bicorn's drop.

18:53.200 --> 18:56.060
What? I can't accept something so valuable!

18:56.060 --> 18:58.580
Just take them. Right, Emily?

18:58.580 --> 19:01.410
Absolutely! They're all yours!

