<i>Celeste can now use level 1 
magic with no limitations.</i>

19:12.390 --> 19:13.650
Huh?

19:14.550 --> 19:17.160
Emily and I talked it over.

19:17.160 --> 19:19.730
We think you should have them.

19:19.730 --> 19:24.150
Thank you for working so 
hard to help us, Celeste!

19:28.360 --> 19:29.840
Thank you...

19:37.280 --> 19:39.820
You defeated the dungeon master?!

19:39.820 --> 19:42.750
Yeah... er, Duke?

19:43.100 --> 19:45.430
This is an unbelievable shock!

19:45.430 --> 19:48.540
W-We must immediately inform the adventurers

19:48.540 --> 19:51.080
and have them see if the 
dungeon ecology has changed!

19:51.080 --> 19:53.000
Thank you, Mr. Sato!

19:55.190 --> 19:58.740
It's amazing that just 
three of you defeated it.

19:58.740 --> 20:01.940
You've been blessed with 
some wonderful companions.

20:01.940 --> 20:03.300
Companions...

20:03.850 --> 20:07.660
You were so amazing back there, Celeste!

20:07.660 --> 20:09.270
So were you, Emily.

20:09.580 --> 20:10.570
Yeah.

20:11.040 --> 20:13.320
Hey, where's Neptune?

20:15.880 --> 20:19.390
I missed my chance to fight with Sato.

20:19.390 --> 20:22.450
And it's all because of 
your stupid bullying.

20:22.780 --> 20:24.540
Aw, man.

20:24.700 --> 20:27.830
So... what are you gonna do about it?

20:43.190 --> 20:44.390
Celeste.

20:45.670 --> 20:46.980
Ryota!

20:46.980 --> 20:48.770
These are amazing!

20:48.770 --> 20:51.820
I never thought I'd be able 
to use level 1 magic!

20:51.820 --> 20:53.650
It's truly like a dream come true!

20:53.820 --> 20:56.320
I'm glad you're so happy with it.

20:56.320 --> 20:58.320
By the way, I heard

20:58.320 --> 21:00.840
that Selen belongs to Secro from now on.

21:00.840 --> 21:05.810
Yeah. They confirmed that the 
dungeon's ecology didn't change.

21:06.320 --> 21:09.600
A lot happened, but now it's finally over.

21:10.160 --> 21:13.400
So... when are you leaving for Secro?

21:13.400 --> 21:14.750
Tomorrow, maybe?

21:15.070 --> 21:16.290
I see.

21:18.830 --> 21:21.760
Hey, Celeste... If you want...

21:21.760 --> 21:23.290
Why don't you come with us?

21:21.760 --> 21:23.290
I'll go with you!

21:25.690 --> 21:28.090
What? You're asking me to?

21:28.090 --> 21:29.610
Well, I mean...

21:29.610 --> 21:33.040
Remember when she called 
us "companions" yesterday?

21:33.040 --> 21:36.580
I thought it might be nice 
to really be like that...

21:36.580 --> 21:39.620
so I was thinking of starting up... 
like, "Ryota's Party," maybe.

21:39.650 --> 21:42.080
I love it! Let's do that!

21:42.250 --> 21:43.970
Oh, glad to hear it!

21:44.440 --> 21:46.930
We'll have to talk to Emily—

21:46.930 --> 21:49.310
I'm absolutely in!

21:50.050 --> 21:52.000
You were there, Emily?!

21:52.000 --> 21:52.940
Yes!

21:52.940 --> 21:57.190
I'll be in the Yoda Family with 
Celeste! It sounds like fun!

21:57.190 --> 21:58.740
Let's do our best together!

22:00.100 --> 22:03.900
Yeah. Glad to have you with us, Celeste!

22:06.170 --> 22:07.210
Of course!
